{#- Tier 2 of the off-scene cast directory: characters active in this campaign
    but not in this scene, each with their campaign dossier paragraph. Vars:
      offscene_active — [{name, dossier}]

    Tier 3 is the sibling section off_scene_cast_known.j2, and the two are
    joined by system.j2's blank line into the single block they were split out
    of. The block's shared heading is in neither file: it is declared as this
    section's `Section.heading` and emitted by the render path — see
    scene/off_scene_cast_heading.j2. -#}
{%- set lines = [] -%}
{%- for a in offscene_active -%}{%- set _ = lines.append(a.name ~ ": " ~ a.dossier) -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- if lines -%}
{{ "## Active in this campaign, elsewhere\n" ~ (lines | join("\n")) }}
{%- endif -%}
